<title>NEW ZEALAND: Advantage year net profit falls 22 pct.</title>
<headline>Advantage year net profit falls 22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  2.37 vs 3.06</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				11.86 vs 15.30</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  3.0 vs 4.6</p>
<p>    Total div for yr (cents)		 6.0 vs 7.6</p>
<p>    Turnover				   48.97 vs 40.21</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			     3.60 vs 4.52</p>
<p>    Tax					   1.23 vs 1.46</p>
<p>Dividend carries 1.4776 cps imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date Nov 29</p>
<p>Reg date Nov 22</p>
<p>    Ex div   Nov 25</p>
<p>Note - Advantage Group Ltd is a supplier of electronic scanning equipment, cash registers and terminals.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
